---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <h1>Sparking a lasting passion for STEM</h1>
    <p>
      LABRATS is an organization dedicated to making STEM education accessible and fun for all young learners. We run several science programs at community centres across Vancouver, Canada, with a full experiment log on this site for anyone to try at home. We also develop fun and educational science kits for children.
    </p>
    <a href="https://anc.ca.apm.activecommunities.com/vancouver/activity/search/detail/619658" class="hero-cta">
      Register now at Kerrisdale Community Centre
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 4rem 2rem 4.5rem;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 3rem;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    max-width: 22ch;
  }

  p {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #333;
    max-width: 68ch;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: var(--color-navy);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .hero-cta:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    h1 {
      font-size: 2.1rem;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
